@startuml
title bl / breakpoints — List breakpoints
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor "User" as U
participant "TerminalUI" as UI
participant "DebugSession" as S
U -> UI : bl / breakpoints
UI -> S : Read line_breakpoints
S --> UI : Requested lines, resolved ranges and conditions
UI --> U : Result or command error; return to prompt
@enduml
